                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tower to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-02-03"><hi rendition="#italic">February 3,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Tower reports that he has communicated the contents of the Department’s
                    telegram of February 1, relating to Manchuria, to the Russian Government.)</p>
            </div>
